# <<PROJECT_NAME>> Weekly Advisor Cryo

This is a Cryochamber chamber for a scheduled weekly advisor agent. It was scaffolded from the `create-weekly-advisor-cryo` skill and follows the benchmark.harness pattern.

## Files

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `plan.md` | Standing weekly advisor mission. |
| `cryo.toml` | Cryochamber config. |
| `NOTES.md` | Durable agent memory. |
| `CLAUDE.md` | Chamber operating instructions. |
| `mailbox/` | Messenger inbox/outbox for team-channel messages. |
| `.claude/skills/mailbox-send/` | Skill for writing valid mailbox outbox envelopes. |

## Start

Review `plan.md` and configure the messenger/mailbox bridge before starting a live weekly advisor.

```sh
cryo status
cryo start
cryo watch
```

To smoke test without team-channel posting:

```sh
cryo send --from operator --subject "smoke test" --wake "Confirm your weekly advisor mission, do not post to the team channel yet."
```

